  "description": "Pins the Myne dialect highlight parser (src/dialect/lezer/highlight.ts) — which byte ranges are recognized as Highlight / HighlightMark. UTF-8 byte offsets. recognize cases carry the spans; inert cases carry an empty list. TS-runner category.",
